  "fullDescription": "Add an elegant festive touch to your holiday collection with this Elegant Christmas Tree Snowflake 3D STL. This decorative Christmas tree features a graceful openwork silhouette, star-shaped cutouts, a large central snowflake ornament, hanging baubles, and a beautiful star topper, all finished with a detailed pedestal base.\n\nIts elegant layered design makes it ideal for Christmas tabletop displays, shelves, mantels, holiday centerpieces, seasonal home decor, and festive decorating.\n\nFeatures\nElegant Christmas tree silhouette\nLarge decorative snowflake centerpiece\nStar-shaped cutout details\nHanging ornament accents\nDecorative star topper\nDetailed pedestal base\nBeautiful openwork design\nPerfect for Christmas and winter displays\nSuitable for tabletop, shelf, mantel, and centerpiece decor\nDesigned for FDM and resin 3D printing\nScalable to different print sizes\nGreat for Christmas crafting and seasonal gifts\nPerfect For\n\nPerfect for Christmas home decor, holiday centerpieces, tabletop displays, mantel decorations, shelf styling, Christmas village scenes, winter-themed decorations, and handmade seasonal gifts.\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital 3D model file. No physical product will be shipped. Please check your 3D printer and slicing software compatibility before printing. This 3D model is available only in STL color — if you’d like it colored, you’ll need to open the STL file in separate software to color it yourself.",
